/**
 * Mod-manager actions.
 *
 * Customers browse the per-game mod/plugin CATALOG (GameMod) and one-click
 * install/uninstall onto their server. Each change writes the desired state to a
 * `ServerMod` row (INSTALLING / REMOVING) and enqueues a single GAME_MOD_SYNC job
 * that reconciles the server to that state — the same state-driven pattern as
